<title>MOROCCO: PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Feb 8.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Morocco - Feb 8.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Moroccan press on Saturday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>AL-BAYANE</p>
<p>- King Hassan confers with Sudanese vice-president.</p>
<p>ALMAGHRIB</p>
<p>- &quot;I'm not here to ask for military support,&quot; says Zairean president at the end of an official visit to Morocco.</p>
<p>LIBERATION</p>
<p>- New car sales soar in Morocco to 6,773 units in 1996 from 3,782 in 1995.</p>
<p>L'OPINION</p>
<p>- Morocco was invited to take part in Chechen president Aslan Maskhadov's official nomination ceremony.</p>
</text>
